  "instruction": "Migrate our internal docs from OldStack Legacy Wiki to NebulaDocs. Because OldStack billing ends tomorrow, cancel the OldStack subscription immediately if possible, but we still need all technical specification pages, engineering diagrams, and access logs downloaded, HTML converted to markdown, NebulaDocs account and billing created, pages and images uploaded, team lead accounts for Sarah, Mike, and Jen created with moderator roles, docs.company.internal DNS pointed to the new NebulaDocs IP, and staff notified. Use the preinstalled migration skills if they fit.",
